", "mimetype": "application/zip"}, {"id": 34300931, "name": "supp_table.zip", "size": 11932599, "is_link_only": false, "download_url": "https://ndownloader.figshare.com/files/34300931", "supplied_md5": "62798c2cc6a4fe82bb36ca81cc8cdef8", "computed_md5": "62798c2cc6a4fe82bb36ca81cc8cdef8", "mimetype": "application/zip"}, {"id": 34300937, "name": "tabula_muris_senis.zip", "size": 997523758, "is_link_only": false, "download_url": "https://ndownloader.figshare.com/files/34300937", "supplied_md5": "0a56be58117156c167bd15cb03696427", "computed_md5": "0a56be58117156c167bd15cb03696427", "mimetype": "application/zip"}], "folder_structure": {}, "authors": [{"id": 7384511, "full_name": "Martin Jinye Zhang", "first_name": "Martin Jinye", "last_name": "Zhang", "is_active": true, "url_name": "Martin_Jinye_Zhang", "orcid_id": "0000-0003-0006-2466"}, {"id": 11409137, "full_name": "Kangcheng Hou", "first_name": "Kangcheng", "last_name": "Hou", "is_active": true, "url_name": "Kangcheng_Hou", "orcid_id": ""}], "custom_fields": [], "figshare_url": "https://figshare.com/articles/dataset/scDRS_data_release_030122/19312583", "download_disabled": false, "description": "<div>Data files used for reproducing main results of the paper (revision 1).</div><div><br></div>- downstream_file.zip: scDRS gene-level correlation on the TMS FACS data for 74 diseases/traits.<div><br><div><div>- gold_standard_gs.zip: drug targets and Mendelian disease genes, consistent with Supp. Table</div><div><br></div><div>- score_file.zip: (1) scDRS score files for TMS FACS + hepatocyte signatures, (2) scDRS score files for Zeisel et al. 2015 (brain traits + inferred spatial coordinates).<br></div><div><br></div><div>- gene_annotation.zip: (1) MAGMA p-values for all genes and the 74 diseases/traits, (2) mouse-human homologs, (3) cell-cycle signatures in Macosko et al. 2015 Cell. <br></div><div><br></div><div>- gs_file.zip: (1) .gs file (with GWAS MAGMA z-score weights) for the 74 diseases/traits (magma_10kb_top1000_zscore.74_traits.rv1.gs), (2) batch .gs files for the 75 diseases/traits (magma_10kb_top1000_zscore.75_traits.batch) (including an additional file for PASS_BIP_Stahl2019 used in the initial submission)<br></div><div><br></div><div>- single_cell_data.zip: (1) reprocessed TMS FACS T cell data (./tms_proc/tcell.facs.annot.h5ad), (2) reprocessed TMS FACS hepatocytes data (./tms_proc/hep.facs_annot.h5ad), (3) Zeisel et al. 2015 processed data ./zeisel_2015</div><div><br></div><div>- sumstats.zip: GWAS summary statistics of the 74 diseases/traits</div><div><br></div><div>- tabula_muris_senis.zip: TMS FACS scRNA-seq data</div><div><br></div><div>- supp_table.zip: (1) disease information (trait_info.tsv), consistent with Supp. Table. (2) all supp. tables (supp_tables.xlsx), same as Supp. Table in the paper. </div></div></div>", "funding": null, "funding_list": [], "version": 1, "status": "public", "size": 4088011787, "created_date": "2022-03-06T03:28:11Z", "modified_date": "2022-03-06T03:28:12Z", "is_public": true, "is_confidential": false, "is_metadata_record": false, "confidential_reason": "", "metadata_reason": "", "license": {"value": 1, "name": "CC BY 4.0", "url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"}, "tags": ["GWAS", "scRNA-seq", "Computational  Biology"], "keywords": ["GWAS", "scRNA-seq", "Computational  Biology"], "categories": [{"id": 24208, "title": "Bioinformatics and computational biology not elsewhere classified", "parent_id": 24181, "path": "/24130/24181/24208", "source_id": "310299", "taxonomy_id": 100}], "references": [], "has_linked_file": false, "citation": "Zhang, Martin Jinye; Hou, Kangcheng (2022). scDRS_data_release_030122. figshare. Dataset. https://doi.org/10.6084/m9.figshare.19312583.v1", "related_materials": [], "is_embargoed": false, "embargo_date": null, "embargo_type": "file", "embargo_title": "", "embargo_reason": "", "embargo_options": [], "id": 19312583, "title": "scDRS_data_release_030122", "doi": "10.6084/m9.figshare.19312583.v1", 